================================================================================
Embedded tree-sitter grammars
================================================================================

The binary statically links generated C parser code bundled by
github.com/smacker/go-tree-sitter. These parsers are generated from grammars
maintained by the tree-sitter project (https://github.com/tree-sitter) and
individual grammar authors, and are distributed under the MIT License. The
grammars compiled into codistill cover the following languages:

    C#          (tree-sitter-c-sharp)
    Java        (tree-sitter-java)
    PHP         (tree-sitter-php)
    Python      (tree-sitter-python)
    Rust        (tree-sitter-rust)
    TypeScript  (tree-sitter-typescript)

